# Re-include the SDD documentation tree for this package.
#
# The repository root ignores `packages/**/docs/` (.gitignore:2), which would otherwise make the
# canonical module spec, the repo-standards standing docs, and part of the seeded template snapshot
# unversionable. The SDD manifest schema enumerates `docs_root: docs`,
# `standing_docs_root: docs`, and `spec_index_path: docs/specs/README.md`, so relocating them is not
# permitted; they are re-included here instead.
#
# Generated run records under `.generated/` stay ignored by the root rule and are deliberately not
# re-included.

# Standing docs and the canonical module spec.
!/docs/
!/docs/**
!/src/docs/
!/src/docs/**

# The seeded repo-standards template snapshot, including its own docs/ subtree. The manifest
# requires `layout.template_roots.canonical` to be `.sdd/templates/repo-standards`, so the snapshot
# must be complete in a fresh clone for the SDD gates to resolve their templates.
!/.sdd/templates/**
